2. Online Shopping Cart
Problem Statement

Given a shopping cart, use higher-order functions to:

Calculate the total bill.
Find products costing more than ₹500.
Apply a 10% discount to all products.
const cart = [
  { item: "Headphones", price: 1200 },
  { item: "Notebook", price: 100 },
  { item: "Mouse", price: 700 },
  { item: "Pen", price: 50 }
];

const totalBill = cart.reduce(
  (total, product) => total + product.price,
  0
);

const expensiveProducts = cart.filter(
  product => product.price > 500
);

const discountedProducts = cart.map(product => ({
  ...product,
  price: product.price * 0.9
}));

console.log("Total Bill:", totalBill);
console.log("Expensive Products:", expensiveProducts);
console.log("After Discount:", discountedProducts);
